---
import { GUIDES } from '../../lib/guides';
import BlogLayout from '../../layouts/BlogLayout.astro';
---
<BlogLayout title="JustDB Blog — Notes from the workspace" description="Product notes and practical ideas for working with your databases in JustDB.">
  <section class="intro"><h1>Notes from<br />the workspace.</h1><p>Product details, database workflows, and the small things that make working with your data easier.</p></section>
  <article class="featured">
    <div class="shot"><img src="/features/record-inspector-1200.webp" srcset="/features/record-inspector-600.webp 600w, /features/record-inspector-1200.webp 1200w, /features/record-inspector-1800.webp 1800w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) calc(100vw - 48px), 760px" width="1800" height="1250" alt="A selected database record displayed in JustDB’s row details panel." /></div>
    <div class="featured-copy"><p class="meta">WORKFLOW · 3 MIN READ</p><h2><a href="/blog/inspect-records-without-losing-context">Inspect a record without losing your place.</a></h2><p>A table gives you the overview. The row inspector gives you the details. Here’s how to use both in the same workspace.</p><a class="read" href="/blog/inspect-records-without-losing-context">Read the article <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
  </article>
  <section class="articles" aria-labelledby="articles-heading">
    <h2 id="articles-heading">More from the blog</h2>
    <div class="article-grid">
      {GUIDES.map((post) => (
        <article class="article-card">
          <p class="meta">{post.tag}</p>
          <h3><a href={`/blog/${post.slug}`}>{post.title}</a></h3>
          <p>{post.summary}</p>
          <a class="read" href={`/blog/${post.slug}`}>Read the article <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

</BlogLayout>

<style>
  .articles { margin:64px 0 96px; }
  .articles h2 { font-size:24px; margin-bottom:24px; }
  .article-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:24px; }
  .article-card { padding:24px; border:1px solid #2e2e2e; border-radius:8px; }
  .article-card h3 { font-size:22px; line-height:1.3; margin:16px 0; }
  .article-card > p:not(.meta) { color:#b4b4b4; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; }
  @media(max-width:760px) { .article-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
</style>
